    },
    "b0006-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "7a1a1af4dd942d1e6738dfa823625c5edf13948fd903589cf2290322611efe0e",
      "targetHash": "e4689372417c490470ed45d01c7bc7909c8e7cf523a1239fb6417610062b644c",
      "machineHash": "e4689372417c490470ed45d01c7bc7909c8e7cf523a1239fb6417610062b644c",
      "machineText": "在 v1 中，許多人都希望能更充分地控制視窗本身。我很高興地宣布，現在已有專為此用途設計的新執行階段 API。它功能豐富，並支援多螢幕設定。對話方塊 API 也有所改進：現在，你可以使用具備豐富設定選項的現代化原生對話方塊，滿足所有對話方塊需求。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There were a huge number of requests in v1 for the ability to have greater\\ control of the window it…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
