      "targetHash": "edd6b2dcc368b8f54dca8cebf33f589692b0e0989334ca89829b3597401827aa",
      "machineHash": "edd6b2dcc368b8f54dca8cebf33f589692b0e0989334ca89829b3597401827aa",
      "machineText": "沒錯，它的運作方式就像網頁伺服器，但它並不是網頁伺服器。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Yes, it works just like a webserver, except it isn't.",
