      "machineHash": "8c207253f20f23097b910b66a73a19711c807e7d717789e5357e0ab03f613534",
      "machineText": "既然資源不再需要綑綁，就能帶來全新的開發體驗。新的`wails dev`命令會建置並執行應用程式，但不會使用`embed.FS`中的資源，而是直接從磁碟載入。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Now that assets don't need to be bundled, it's enabled a whole new development\\ experience. The new …",
