    "b0018-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f197c0f9e5f5cf10e17ca7feff17b0cd8f0e4c598847e9fc5e008e7e913bd1c2",
      "targetHash": "c63dbc2654b44153bf9880a682223937eaae0d007776a3781ab6dad1e3a244f5",
      "machineHash": "c63dbc2654b44153bf9880a682223937eaae0d007776a3781ab6dad1e3a244f5",
      "machineText": "此外，系統會在連接埠34115上啟動網頁伺服器，將應用程式提供給任何連線至該伺服器的瀏覽器。所有已連線的網頁瀏覽器都會回應系統事件，例如資源變更時的熱重新載入。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, a webserver will start on port 34115. This will serve your\\ application to any …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0019-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d011d90fb9ff0557dec77e87205e0636f2d1cf1b5ab76a9238bd390f6dad3631",
      "targetHash": "25e3178983ac85ca9b36e4ab6d0ef7ddf37043bdde122d93959d749288b3200a",
      "machineHash": "25e3178983ac85ca9b36e4ab6d0ef7ddf37043bdde122d93959d749288b3200a",
      "machineText": "使用 Go 時，我們習慣在應用程式中處理結構體。將結構體傳送至前端，並在應用程式中將其用作狀態，通常很有幫助。在 v1 中，這個過程大多必須手動完成，對開發人員而言有些負擔。我很高興地宣布，在 v2 中，只要應用程式以開發模式執行，就會自動為所有作為已繫結方法輸入或輸出參數的結構體產生 TypeScript 模型。如此即可在這兩個環境之間順暢交換資料模型。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In Go, we are used to dealing with structs in our applications. It's often\\ useful to send structs t…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0020-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e4a6145b3a813cb9128eeed038c86ca46725187be24a9bb2ca09de244178097b",
      "targetHash": "d599328639b0949ffffc544256bc6e60dea8f017a4c9c73d6fb0965b60e89941",
      "machineHash": "d599328639b0949ffffc544256bc6e60dea8f017a4c9c73d6fb0965b60e89941",
      "machineText": "除此之外，系統還會動態產生另一個 JS 模組，封裝所有已繫結的方法。這會為你的方法提供 JSDoc，讓 IDE 能夠提供程式碼自動完成與提示。在封裝 Go 程式碼的自動產生模組中按下 Tab 鍵，就能自動匯入資料模型，真的非常酷！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, another JS module is dynamically generated wrapping all\\ your bound methods. Th…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
